<title>SPAIN: Spain to tackle income tax reform next year-Costa.</title>
<headline>Spain to tackle income tax reform next year-Costa.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain plans to tackle income tax reform next year, Tax Secretary Juan Costa said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are going to work on a reform of income tax to simplify and streamline it and resolve some of the pending tax issues, of which I think there are several,&quot; Costa told journalists.</p>
<p>He alluded to the need to simplify rates and look at taxation of savings.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
